{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AI Powered racing like you've never seen before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Instead of driving, you manage your driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience an autobattler with roguelite mechanics that focuses on the thrill of racing. Overcome each race's challenges and win co-op championships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/9c84418fd16a1f8d5e0b2e8623bf3486.poster.avif?t=1762797455\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/9c84418fd16a1f8d5e0b2e8623bf3486.webm?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/9c84418fd16a1f8d5e0b2e8623bf3486.mp4?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Short-burst races</strong>, allowing you to quickly hop in and get straight to the action. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Every race is unique.</strong> Experience different race lengths, dynamic weather conditions and random upgrades. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>All racing is real - nothing is scripted.</strong> Driven by machine learning AI. Naturally observe the craziest of overtakes and the hardest of crashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Play with or against your friends.</strong> Battle it out or compete in the Career Mode championships together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/da4a62803dc5a216fe02ce9edcbcd3ea.poster.avif?t=1762797455\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/da4a62803dc5a216fe02ce9edcbcd3ea.webm?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/da4a62803dc5a216fe02ce9edcbcd3ea.mp4?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upgrade your car.</strong>\u00a0While driving, select random upgrades, unlock bonus upgrades and build the fastest car to win each race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Plan strategic pit stops.</strong> Manage your pit stops and utilize many different tire compounds to optimize your race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your boost.</strong> Manipulate your car by using boosts and aerodynamics buffs. Assist your driver with overtakes, defending and by setting overall faster lap times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Navigate the weather.</strong> Experience dynamic weather changes throughout the race. Will it stay dry, or risk making a pit stop for wet tires? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/e22ddffcbe2aba3324d8808136952262.poster.avif?t=1762797455\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/e22ddffcbe2aba3324d8808136952262.webm?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/e22ddffcbe2aba3324d8808136952262.mp4?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Start your Career Mode.</strong>\u00a0Unlock championships by winning in others. Climb your way through the ladder and become the best ever Backseat Champion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock teams and customizations.</strong>\u00a0Level up throughout your racing adventure. Unlock car customization features such as wheel rims, helmet designs, teams to choose from and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Your choices matter.</strong>\u00a0Everyone starts on equal footing. Infinite possibilities. Where will you make the difference?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race unique cars.</strong> From classic Formula cars all the way to modern Endurance cars. Face new challenges in different race dynamics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/08e11c044090c72891c97a6851d04fff.poster.avif?t=1762797455\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/08e11c044090c72891c97a6851d04fff.webm?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/extras/08e11c044090c72891c97a6851d04fff.mp4?t=1762797455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Note on AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This project does NOT use Generative AI.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The drivers are powered by reinforcement learning using conventional, non-generative neural network models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All training was done from scratch using self-made training environments built within the 50+ tracks of the game, and run from personal servers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No copyrighted material, or third-party data, was used during the development of the game. All assets were created either by commissioned artists or myself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2174510?t=1762797455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762797455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/6f4b3d63557c2e2cef4d83e025898c5bb5f75aad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762797455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174510/6f4b3d63557c2e2cef4d83e025898c5bb5f75aad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762797455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AI Powered racing like you've never seen before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Instead of driving, you manage your driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience an autobattler with roguelite mechanics that focuses on the thrill of racing. O